<Slide notes={`所以我固定预测、只换区间构造，四步。先用 15 个模型冻结预测；再给每台发动机一个干净的校准分数；然后套 9 种规则、4 个名义水平；最后只在 653 台测试机上读一次标签。数据是 C-MAPSS 四个舰队加 N-CMAPSS 2,587 条查询，两个骨干共 120 次训练。除了区间规则，其他变量全部对齐。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>固定预测，只换区间构造</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DCE7F7' }}>02 · 设计</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, height: 504, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 18, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>所有比较在同一套预测上完成，差异只来自区间规则。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 200, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 275, height: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>STEP 01</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>冻结预测</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8 }}>15 模型均值：5 折 × 3 seed，一次训练多次复用</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 22 }}>输出：15 个模型</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 275, height: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>STEP 02</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>校准残差</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8 }}>每台发动机一个干净分数；部署对象与校准对象对齐</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 22 }}>输出：每机 1 个分数</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 275, height: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>STEP 03</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>构造区间</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8 }}>9 种规则 × 4 个名义水平：0.50 / 0.80 / 0.90 / 0.95</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 22 }}>输出：9 × 4 组区间</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 275, height: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderTop: '3px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>STEP 04</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 6 }}>只读一次</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8 }}>653 台测试机；测试标签不参与校准与选择</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 22 }}>输出：653 个查询</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 140, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 370, height: 140, background: '#F7F9FC', padding: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>数据规模</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 4 }}>708 训练 / 653 测试</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>C-MAPSS 四舰队；N-CMAPSS 2,587 条查询</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 370, height: 140, background: '#F7F9FC', padding: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>模型规模</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 4 }}>120 次训练 / 2 个骨干</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>主骨干 41,858 参数；第二骨干 119,490；参数层 66</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 370, height: 140, background: '#F7F9FC', padding: 18, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>统计规模</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 4 }}>200 次仿真 × 5 个规模</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 4 }}>10,000 次置换；2,000 次引擎自助；5 个消融臂</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 48, marginTop: 16, borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 16, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>换骨干、不换规则：覆盖率从 0.75 到 0.95，宽度排序不变。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, bottom: 20, height: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>RUL 区间测量学 · 课题组进展汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>03 / 10</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
